            "text": "In 2022, Astana Hub launched Silkway Accelerator - today, it stands as the only accelerator in Central Asia for PMF- and Scale-stage startups, delivered in partnership with Google for Startups.\n\nNow, the journey leads to Almaty. For the first time, Cohort 7 will take place at Almaty Hub with the support of the Akimat of Almaty.\n\nWhat the program delivers:\n🔹 Revenue and core metrics growth\n🔹 Stronger sales performance\n🔹 Refined unit economics\n🔹 Business scaling\n🔹 Investment readiness\n\n📍 3 months offline in Almaty\n🎁 Free coworking and co-living for 2 team members\n📌 Visa support for international startups\n🎓 Mentorship from Google for Startups and Astana Hub\n\nApply via the link in @almaty.hub bio\n🗓 Deadline: April 30\n9 days left until applications for Silkway Accelerator close."
